  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Mosaic is a tunnel book that explores the experience of standing on the mosaic floor of the Basilica of San Marco in Venice, Italy. In the church the patterns are all encompassing and beautiful. The eye is drawn into a whirling vortex of pattern. Hand cut linoleum prints present details from the floor mosaics."--Artist's statement, vampandtramp.com.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Linoleum cut prints. Printed on Mohawk 80 lb. paper with a Vandercook press. Housed in an archival box with a linoleum print on the cover."--vampandtramp.com.</subfield>
  </datafield>
